GnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"oXJ-AmZ9sJIc8h2evX3TAA","review_id":"B_5O9GpF2umnOWDE6P6Vwg","date":"2011-02-02T06:28:04","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9214813113212585,"text_excerpt":"Republic gets five stars based solely on the incredible Death Cab for Cutie show I went to there several years ago. Okay, not solely. Things I like about the Republic include: It's large enough to not feel packed at a show, but still small enough that it seems very intimate.. I love that! Private parties upstairs are pretty awesome. You can't smoke in there, so I don't come home smelling disgusting (nor with lung cancer). The bars are large and service is relatively fast for how crowded it can get. The atmosphere is very posh without being pretentious. Bathrooms with many stalls = shorter lines for the ladies' room! (Oh, I feel like I'm 80 having written the phrase \"ladies' room.\" I apolo..."},{"business_id":"oXJ-AmZ9sJIc8h2evX3TAA","review_id":"dhaiJsYv8tspVaqR7w61Fg","date":"2011-03-24T20:05:00","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9200713634490967,"text_excerpt":"I have been to the Republic now for a couple of concerts and I've been here on their regular club nights. This place will give you a totally different impression depending on what is going on. I love this place for small concerts, but their club nights really don't interest me. This is the best small venue I've been to in New Orleans. The concerts that I have attended here have been fantastic. For a small concert, this venue can feel very comfortable/intimate. The last concert I attended was Peter Murphy and I was able to get close to the stage even though I waited until right before he went on to even attempt to get anywhere close. For the times I've attended their regular club nights I ..."},{"business_id":"oXJ-AmZ9sJIc8h2evX3TAA","review_id":"-_xE7H-EDXj3tt4mnvHXaw","date":"2020-08-26T16:27:38","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.918099045753479,"text_excerpt":"Venue is pretty sweet for smaller concerts and more of an indie vibe. Have been to a few shows here and the set-up is quite sweet. Two wide bars, an upstairs balcony, and bathrooms that are super clean. Staff is very friendly and easy to ask questions. Definitely don't mind coming to shows here."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"oXJ-AmZ9sJIc8h2evX3TAA","photo_id":"s2_o5daJGKZ95wxlAvz7Ug","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/s2_o5daJGKZ95wxlAvz7Ug.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8837778568267822},{"business_id":"oXJ-AmZ9sJIc8h2evX3TAA","photo_id":"QIzxqOuC43zJjrUXTfT8DA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/QIzxqOuC43zJjrUXTfT8DA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8382412791252136},{"business_id":"oXJ-AmZ9sJIc8h2evX3TAA","photo_id":"bWep7Tww4_RAMSFr5fXH0w","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/bWep7Tww4_RAMSFr5fXH0w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8341111540794373},{"business_id":"oXJ-AmZ9sJIc8h2evX3TAA","photo_id":"fwmuqJjNvezukpMwQUCtUg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/fwmuqJjNvezukpMwQUCtUg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8136125802993774},{"business_id":"oXJ-AmZ9sJIc8h2evX3TAA","photo_id":"iyq1w-KulCyv5ofsQzQl2w","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/iyq1w-KulCyv5ofsQzQl2w.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7694138288497925}]},"notebook_case":null}
